      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the Commission to Investigate Allegations of Police Corruption and the Anti-Corruption Procedures of the Police Department, chaired by Milton Mollen, (the \"Mollen Commission\") has recently concluded an investigation of the nature, extent and causes of police corruption today; and",
